{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch/runs/train-INC-112-r1/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"content": "INC-112  Transit times are almost twice as long as they should be\nstatus: open   priority: P1   area: eta   reported: 2026-07-23 by vessel-operations\n\nEstimated arrivals are nearly a day late on longer legs. Distances are in nautical miles\nand speeds in knots, so the transit time is simply one divided by the other, but the\nestimate comes out about 85 percent too long.\n\nAcceptance:\n  transitHours(240, 12) returns 20 and transitHours(90, 18) returns 5; arrivalTime uses\n  the corrected transit time. distanceKm still converts nautical miles to kilometres.\n\nFiles:\n  src/eta/transit.ts", "is_error": false, "tool_use_id": "toolu_011Kv34A5uG9np541jNJjpnd", "type": "tool_result"}], "role": "user"}, "sessionId": "7cd98dbb-c0e5-4d66-9950-629311c50ae6", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:34:16.646Z", "toolUseResult": {"stdout": "INC-112  Transit times are almost twice as long as they should be\nstatus: open   priority: P1   area: eta   reported: 2026-07-23 by vessel-operations\n\nEstimated arrivals are nearly a day late on longer legs. Distances are in nautical miles\nand speeds in knots, so the transit time is simply one divided by the other, but the\nestimate comes out about 85 percent too long.\n\nAcceptance:\n  transitHours(240, 12) returns 20 and transitHours(90, 18) returns 5; arrivalTime uses\n  the corrected transit time. distanceKm still converts nautical miles to kilometres.\n\nFiles:\n  src/eta/transit.ts"}, "type": "user"}
