{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch/runs/train-INC-112-r1/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"text": "## Issue Resolved ✓\n\nI've successfully resolved **INC-112: Transit times are almost twice as long as they should be**.\n\n### The Problem\nThe `transitHours` function in `src/eta/transit.ts` was calculating transit time by:\n1. Converting nautical miles to kilometers\n2. Dividing by speed in knots (nautical miles per hour)\n\nThis incorrect unit mixing made estimates ~85% too long.\n\n### The Fix\nChanged line 14 from:\n```ts\nreturn distanceKm(distanceNm) / speedKn;\n```\nto:\n```ts\nreturn distanceNm / speedKn;\n```\n\n### Verification\n- ✓ `transitHours(240, 12)` returns 20 (was ~37)\n- ✓ `transitHours(90, 18)` returns 5 (was ~9.3)\n- ✓ `distanceKm()` still correctly converts to kilometers\n- ✓ All 26 existing tests pass\n\nCommit: `5629d89`", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CfV8qLcM3bxQziN1FwqjQ", "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "role": "assistant"}, "sessionId": "7cd98dbb-c0e5-4d66-9950-629311c50ae6", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:34:51.344Z", "type": "assistant"}
